#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="dotnet"
DISPLAY_NAME=".NET / C#"

DESCRIPTION:
C# services, APIs (ASP.NET Core), or desktop apps on .NET 8+.
Minimal API or controller-based, depending on project size.

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      C# 12
- Runtime:       .NET 8 LTS
- Build:         dotnet build / dotnet publish
- Test:          xUnit (preferred) or NUnit / MSTest
- Mock:          Moq or NSubstitute
- Lint:          Roslyn analyzers + dotnet format
- Format:        dotnet format

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.chloeai → .claude/rules/code.chloeai
- init-project.sh copies tests.chloeai → .claude/rules/tests.chloeai
- Pin SDK version in global.json
